  vendorName: Gatherer Elara
  offerText: I harvested too many medicinal herbs today in the woods. Take this small
    bundle for free. Brew it into a tea, and you will feel much better.
  acceptResultText: You brew the free herbs into a soothing tea. It tastes wonderful
    and immediately clears your sickly cough! A rare moment of true kindness.
  rejectResultText: Suspicious of free handouts, you aggressively throw the herbs
    away. You spend the rest of the night coughing and deeply regretting your paranoia.
